1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:08,240
Late stage Core Formation ?

25
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:10,080
The Chaotic Broken Stars

26
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:12,200
can actually make copies of my body

27
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:14,840
with a higher cultivation than mine.

28
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:23,360
As expected,

29
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:24,720
it even replicated my artifacts.

30
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,320
Ancient God Restriction !

31
00:02:35,040 --> 00:02:36,120
The Ji Realm is ineffective.

32
00:02:37,040 --> 00:02:39,480
That means there is no consciousness to attack...

33
00:02:39,760 --> 00:02:41,440
These things aren't alive.

34
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:49,880
The Ji Realm is useless,

35
00:02:50,720 --> 00:02:52,320
they have the same artifacts as I do.

36
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:54,200
However,

37
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:57,400
this body reconstructed with the Ancient God's inheritance

38
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:59,920
cannot be copied by mere rocks !

39
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:09,080
My reconstructed Ancient God body is indeed strong

40
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:13,880
but it's still very far from what I saw in the memory inheritance.

41
00:03:17,160 --> 00:03:20,280
No wonder those Soul Formation didn't force their way through this place.

42
00:03:21,880 --> 00:03:23,600
It gets exponentially more difficult.

43
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:32,840
In the Land of the Ancient God

44
00:03:33,040 --> 00:03:35,000
not only did I learn restrictions

45
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:37,200
but I also obtained this Ancient God body

46
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:38,960
and I obtained a Soul Core.

47
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:40,960
The Chaotic Broken Stars

48
00:03:41,160 --> 00:03:42,360
can't stop me.

49
00:03:42,760 --> 00:03:44,960
Now, I need to focus on forming a Nascent Soul

50
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:47,040
and then return to Zhao for vengeance.

51
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:54,040
Mo Yun\NQi Huang Sect disciple\NEarly stage Core Formation

52
00:03:55,120 --> 00:03:56,960
Qian Kun\NPoison Devil Palace disciple\NMiddle stage Core Formation

53
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:02,120
Why did I flee here of all places...

54
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:04,160
You have nowhere left to run.

55
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:08,520
The Chaotic Broken Stars is famous in the Sea of Devils.

56
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:12,320
I’ve never heard of someone crossing it.

57
00:04:12,600 --> 00:04:15,120
Don’t tell me you want to try ?

58
00:04:16,640 --> 00:04:17,440
Senior,

59
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,720
Junior was lucky enough

60
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:21,960
to barely escape the Poison Demon Palace.

61
00:04:21,960 --> 00:04:23,720
Why must you kill me ?

62
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:28,200
I'm merely following orders.

63
00:04:28,480 --> 00:04:32,080
You should blame yourself for taking something you shouldn’t have !

64
00:04:34,440 --> 00:04:36,560
This is something that belongs to my master !

65
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:38,120
Does it make a difference ?

66
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:42,000
It’s just a sect that was long destroyed.

67
00:04:42,640 --> 00:04:45,440
You refuse to be the palace lord’s concubine

68
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:47,960
and foolishly stole the treasure furnace.

69
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:52,800
Don’t blame this old man for being ruthless !

70
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:55,280
Senior, if you continue

71
00:04:55,960 --> 00:04:57,440
Junior will enter the Chaotic Broken Stars

72
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:58,920
and you'll leave empty-handed.

73
00:05:00,960 --> 00:05:01,760
Senior,

74
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:03,640
this jade slip

75
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:06,480
contains the most pill recipes of the Qi Huang Sect.

76
00:05:06,840 --> 00:05:09,000
It's as valuable as the furnace.

77
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:12,120
Will you let me go?

78
00:05:13,080 --> 00:05:14,520
if I give you this jade slip ?

79
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:17,880
Fine,

80
00:05:17,880 --> 00:05:19,680
give me the jade slip.

81
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:21,680
Once I confirm it’s real,

82
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:23,320
I’ll let you leave.

83
00:05:24,960 --> 00:05:26,800
Please Senior, retreat 1000 zhang

84
00:05:27,280 --> 00:05:28,880
and I’ll leave the jade slip here

85
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:30,200
after I leave.

86
00:05:30,200 --> 00:05:32,880
Nonsense ! I don't have time to play games with you !

87
00:05:39,720 --> 00:05:41,280
Senior, how could you break your word ?

88
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:45,080
Since you’re so sensible,

89
00:05:45,080 --> 00:05:48,480
I’ll make sure you die comfortably !

90
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:53,840
That’s...

91
00:05:55,400 --> 00:05:56,200
A person !?

92
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:59,440
How did he cross the Chaotic Broken Stars ?

93
00:06:00,280 --> 00:06:03,480
I once saw a Nascent Soul Elder from the Poison Demon Palace

94
00:06:03,520 --> 00:06:06,960
being anihilated by the Chaotic Broken Stars.

95
00:06:07,320 --> 00:06:09,360
Even his Nascent Soul couldn’t escape...

96
00:06:10,440 --> 00:06:12,560
What cultivation does this person have ?

97
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:15,360
Could he be Soul Formation ?

98
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:20,800
Junior Mo Yun of the Qi Huang Sect

99
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:22,000
pays respects to Senior.

100
00:06:22,400 --> 00:06:25,400
Junior Qian Kun 5th-generation disciple of Poison Demon Palace

101
00:06:25,400 --> 00:06:26,720
pays respects to Senior.

102
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:30,760
What’s the nearest city from here ?

103
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:33,560
Senior, 300 000 li west of here

104
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:34,680
is Qilin City.

105
00:06:35,400 --> 00:06:37,920
Junior can guide you there.

106
00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:41,520
As long as this person is here,

107
00:06:42,160 --> 00:06:43,960
Qian Kun won’t dare to attack me.

108
00:06:47,400 --> 00:06:49,520
Does Qilin City have Soul Formation cultivators ?

109
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:50,960
Of course not !

110
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:54,200
Senior, Qilin City doesn't have any Soul Formation cultivators.

111
00:06:54,840 --> 00:06:57,560
Even among the 10 major cities of the Sea of Devils,

112
00:06:57,800 --> 00:06:59,480
there are very few.

113
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:01,280
Ever since

114
00:07:01,320 --> 00:07:03,240
several famous Soul Formation Devil Lords

115
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:05,480
disappeared within the Chaotic Broken Stars,

116
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:08,800
Soul Formation cultivators became a rare sight in the Sea of Devils.

117
00:07:10,080 --> 00:07:12,400
Which Soul Formation cultivators

118
00:07:12,400 --> 00:07:14,000
disappeared in this Chaotic Broken Stars ?

119
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:14,800
Senior,

120
00:07:15,520 --> 00:07:16,480
200 years ago

121
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:19,160
Poison Devil City Lord, Meng Qingfan,

122
00:07:19,640 --> 00:07:21,480
Devil Lord of Qi Mei City, Duanmu Ji,

123
00:07:22,120 --> 00:07:24,120
the Xuan Tian Sect Leader, the Six Desires Devil Lord

124
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:26,720
and Ancient Emperor, Gu Di

125
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:29,640
all agreed to meet in the Chaotic Broken Stars

126
00:07:29,760 --> 00:07:30,680
and vanished.

127
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:33,160
Their disciples

128
00:07:33,160 --> 00:07:35,160
have been looking for them for 200 years

129
00:07:35,560 --> 00:07:37,680
but didn't find a single clue.

130
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:43,440
I didn't think that 200 years would go by like that.

131
00:07:46,760 --> 00:07:48,480
So Hunchback Meng was your Ancestor ?

132
00:07:50,200 --> 00:07:51,000
This is bad...

133
00:07:51,440 --> 00:07:53,480
The Ancestor went around the world

134
00:07:53,480 --> 00:07:54,920
making countless enemies...

135
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:56,240
Judging by his attitude,

136
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:58,160
he must have a grudge with the Ancestor.

137
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:16,800
If the word spreads out that I walked out of the Chaotic Broken Stars,

138
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:18,800
trouble is bound to follow me.

139
00:08:20,760 --> 00:08:22,040
Brat, don’t run !

140
00:08:22,520 --> 00:08:24,680
Let Uncle Xu devour you

141
00:08:24,960 --> 00:08:27,840
to repay Master's favor of letting me out again !

142
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:31,200
This...

143
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:34,760
This artifact is actually a Nascent Soul slave ?

144
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:57,680
With the Ancient God Tactic,

145
00:08:58,200 --> 00:09:00,320
my body can absorb 80% of a Golden Core

146
00:09:01,400 --> 00:09:03,360
and convert the remaining 20% to spiritual energy.

147
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:05,080
That's really impressive.

148
00:09:16,800 --> 00:09:17,600
Senior,

149
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:20,600
Junior has a residence in Qilin City.

150
00:09:21,280 --> 00:09:23,320
With Junior's status as a resident,

151
00:09:23,760 --> 00:09:24,800
Senior

152
00:09:25,040 --> 00:09:27,400
doesn't need to worry about anything.

153
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:35,960
This restriction activates every 3 days.

154
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:38,760
When it activated, your spiritual energy will be in chaos.

155
00:09:39,520 --> 00:09:41,280
If I don't stop it within 15 minutes,

156
00:09:42,120 --> 00:09:44,120
you'll instantly turn to a puddle of blood.

157
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:46,880
Don't try to pull any tricks.

158
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:50,000
Lead the way.

159
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:03,280
The legend says

160
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:06,200
that Qilin City already existed before the mist

161
00:10:04,080 --> 00:10:07,160
Qilin City\NSea of Devils

162
00:10:06,800 --> 00:10:08,200
of the Sea of Devils condensed.

163
00:10:08,760 --> 00:10:10,800
It's one of the 10 major cities in the Sea of Devils.

164
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:12,760
Take me to your residence.

165
00:10:19,720 --> 00:10:20,640
Jade token.

166
00:10:21,680 --> 00:10:22,480
You can enter.

167
00:10:50,280 --> 00:10:51,080
Senior,

168
00:10:52,480 --> 00:10:54,520
Yun’er fell in love with you at first sight,

169
00:10:54,680 --> 00:10:56,000
I’d never betray you.

170
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:58,840
Could you please lift this restriction ?

171
00:11:02,400 --> 00:11:03,880
Don’t do anything unnecessary.

172
00:11:05,560 --> 00:11:08,240
Junior... won’t dare !

173
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:11,680
I won’t stay in the Sea of Devils for too long.

174
00:11:12,040 --> 00:11:14,920
I'll lift the restriction when I leave.

175
00:11:16,480 --> 00:11:20,240
If you say anything about me coming out of the Chaotic Broken Stars,

176
00:11:20,560 --> 00:11:22,360
don’t blame me for being ruthless.

177
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:24,800
Understood, Senior...

178
00:11:58,440 --> 00:12:00,480
Once Tuo Sen leaves the Land of the Ancient God,

179
00:12:01,400 --> 00:12:03,560
he will look for me for the memory inheritance.

180
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:07,800
I obtained quite a few artifacts in this trip.

181
00:12:08,120 --> 00:12:09,160
No matter what,

182
00:12:09,880 --> 00:12:11,760
I must quickly form my Nascent Soul.

183
00:12:13,240 --> 00:12:14,480
These 9 artifacts

184
00:12:14,520 --> 00:12:16,280
still have lingering Divine Sense

185
00:12:16,680 --> 00:12:18,800
even if their owners are dead

186
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:20,800
so I can't use them.

187
00:12:36,280 --> 00:12:37,840
This one might be worth a try.

188
00:13:28,960 --> 00:13:30,080
Hurry up, leave !

189
00:14:07,080 --> 00:14:08,960
With this artifact to help us,

190
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:10,640
Master is sure to form a Nascent Soul !

191
00:14:11,960 --> 00:14:14,960
Master, are you going to kill that girl ?

192
00:14:14,960 --> 00:14:16,360
Just ask me !

193
00:14:16,920 --> 00:14:17,720
Shut up.

194
00:14:22,480 --> 00:14:23,800
Nascent Soul is imminent.

195
00:14:23,800 --> 00:14:24,920
Just to be safe,

196
00:14:24,920 --> 00:14:27,440
I'll find the materials to refine a Restriction Flag.

197
00:14:39,720 --> 00:14:41,000
Shopkeeper, I’ll take this.

198
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:42,560
Fellow cultivator has good taste !

199
00:15:03,520 --> 00:15:06,160
She’s clearly plotting something.

200
00:15:06,240 --> 00:15:08,360
Master, you must strike first.

201
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:09,920
Quickly send me to devour her !

202
00:15:10,440 --> 00:15:11,240
Not yet.

203
00:15:11,800 --> 00:15:12,920
I want to see

204
00:15:13,440 --> 00:15:14,640
if anyone in Qilin City

205
00:15:14,880 --> 00:15:17,240
can break my restriction.

206
00:15:18,560 --> 00:15:21,360
Treasure Refining Pavilion

207
00:15:18,600 --> 00:15:20,680
Master is an Enlightened of Restriction Mountain.

208
00:15:20,680 --> 00:15:23,440
No one in this shabby city could possibly break it.

209
00:15:26,440 --> 00:15:29,000
Fellow cultivator, take a look at our talismans and pills.

210
00:15:44,760 --> 00:15:46,480
With Flood Dragon bones

211
00:15:46,600 --> 00:15:47,840
the formation

212
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:49,240
will resist Core Formation cultivators for days.

213
00:15:49,520 --> 00:15:51,160
The core has healing properties.

214
00:15:51,200 --> 00:15:53,600
The marrow is even more precious, it's concentrated spiritual energy.

215
00:15:53,960 --> 00:15:55,840
I took the liberty of crafting it

216
00:15:56,400 --> 00:15:58,200
so that Senior may use it.

217
00:15:59,320 --> 00:16:00,600
It's been 200 years...

218
00:16:02,320 --> 00:16:04,210
I wonder where she is now...

219
00:16:03,800 --> 00:16:04,760
Senior !

220
00:16:05,040 --> 00:16:08,200
This hide was stripped from the Flood Dragon

221
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:09,520
right after its death.

222
00:16:10,480 --> 00:16:12,080
The cultivator who skinned the dragon

223
00:16:12,520 --> 00:16:14,640
was a famous Foundation Establishment cultivator

224
00:16:14,920 --> 00:16:17,560
200 years ago in the outskirts of the Sea of Devils.

225
00:16:17,920 --> 00:16:21,320
He had a breakthrough despite being chased by Core Formation cultivators  !

226
00:16:21,880 --> 00:16:23,320
After he reached Core Formation,

227
00:16:23,320 --> 00:16:25,640
he slaughtered all his pursuers

228
00:16:26,040 --> 00:16:29,200
and he even forced a Middle stage Core Formation

229
00:16:29,440 --> 00:16:31,640
to use the Hundred Days Execution Order !

230
00:16:33,160 --> 00:16:34,680
Get me everything on this list.

231
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:37,800
Right away !

232
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:50,560
Senior,

233
00:16:50,560 --> 00:16:52,640
can you really break the restriction ?

234
00:17:06,560 --> 00:17:07,840
Come up,

235
00:17:08,480 --> 00:17:10,920
I will break the restriction.

236
00:17:11,480 --> 00:17:13,120
But you must tell me

237
00:17:13,560 --> 00:17:17,560
who placed this restriction on you.

238
00:17:26,020 --> 00:19:41,760
You might be wondering why Wang Lin says that he needs to focus on Nascent Soul when we weren't ever shown him advance further than Early stage Core Formation.\NThere are 2 breakthroughs in the novel during the Land of the Ancient God that weren't shown in the donghua.\N\NThe first one happens in episode 31 when Wang Lin took 7 years to learn restrictions and his hair turned white due to the stress. At that time, his cultivation naturally broke through to Middle stage Core Formation.\N\NThe second one happens in episode 34 when Wang Lin obtained the crystal of memory inheritance that the Sky Devil Magician condensed by killing the Six Desires Devil Lord. Right after that he hides for some time in the Heaven Defying Bead to cultivate and let some time pass because he was being chased. During that time he learns to use the Ancient God Tactic to devour Golden Cores he has in his bag of holding along with the pills Li Muwan made for him and he reached Late stage Core Formation.\N\NWhen he went back to find Ma Liang's corpse in the previous episode, he recovers his Golden Core for his new body. Since it's his own, he's able to merge it with his new body and he automatically becomes Late stage Core Formation again.

239
00:17:34,470 --> 00:17:38,350
I've had my share of wounds,

240
00:17:36,510 --> 00:17:38,350
now I want to fight back.

241
00:17:38,430 --> 00:17:41,910
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

242
00:17:41,990 --> 00:17:47,830
that's blocking all my hopes

243
00:17:44,870 --> 00:17:47,830
for life ?

244
00:17:49,630 --> 00:17:53,590
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

245
00:17:51,350 --> 00:17:53,590
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

246
00:17:53,910 --> 00:17:56,990
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

247
00:17:57,350 --> 00:18:02,990
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

248
00:18:00,070 --> 00:18:02,990
out of reach.

249
00:18:04,350 --> 00:18:08,470
Immortals

250
00:18:05,390 --> 00:18:08,470
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

251
00:18:08,750 --> 00:18:12,510
Renegades

252
00:18:09,510 --> 00:18:12,510
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

253
00:18:12,510 --> 00:18:16,350
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

254
00:18:14,460 --> 00:18:16,350
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

255
00:18:16,590 --> 00:18:20,470
because I don't see the harm in that.

256
00:18:22,470 --> 00:18:28,270
My new body opens its eyes

257
00:18:24,990 --> 00:18:28,270
and awakens from its dream.

258
00:18:28,390 --> 00:18:35,830
I have overcome many trials

259
00:18:30,510 --> 00:18:35,830
to get this body back.

260
00:18:36,030 --> 00:18:43,470
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

261
00:18:40,070 --> 00:18:43,470
I can still see.

262
00:18:43,870 --> 00:18:52,830
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

263
